# Ho so khach co PII/gia that — KHONG duoc vao image. Duong dan doi 11/08/2026 khi gom
# tai lieu theo khach; `COPY . .` doc THU MUC LAM VIEC chu khong doc git, nen thu muc da
# gitignore van se bi chep vao neu khong liet ke o day.
docs/khach-hang/*/nguon-goc/ho-so-khao-sat
docs/khach-hang/*/design-app
*.docx
docs/pdf
# GOI KHACH — CACH LY DU LIEU. `tenants/<slug>/data/knowledge.json` cua khach that co the chua
# gia/PII/chat ID va KHONG duoc vao build context. Ngoai le DUY NHAT la `transport-preview`:
# day la goi synthetic/demo, khong chua du lieu khach, va Railway Railpack can no o runtime vi
# khong co volume mount host nhu Compose. Dockerfile production xoa lai toan bo `tenants/`
# TRUOC runtime stage, nen generic production image van khong mang bat ky tenant pack nao.
# Khoa cuoi cung van la deploy/netviet/image-isolation.contract.mjs — no kiem IMAGE THAT.
tenants/*
!tenants/transport-preview
!tenants/transport-preview/**
# FIXTURE KIEM THU mang dung hinh dang goi khach (`tenant.json`) nen guardrail tren bao do, du du
# lieu ben trong la tong hop (`slug: e2e-fixture`). Cach dung khong phai la noi long guardrail: bo
# test E2E von khong co viec gi trong image chay that. Playwright chay tu checkout o job `e2e` cua
# CI chu khong chay tu image, va khong file nguon nao import `apps/api/src/e2e`, nen loai o day
# khong lam hong kiem thu nao — chi bot thu ra khoi image.
**/e2e
# Unit/integration fixtures are checkout-only verification data. They are not runtime code and some
# deliberately mirror a tenant package (`tenant.json`, `knowledge.json`) to exercise fail-fast loading.
# Keep the structural image guard strict: exclude the test trees instead of teaching it fixture names.
**/__tests__

# UNG DUNG DI DONG (#394) — ma nguon Expo/React Native, KHONG chay trong image may chu. Loai khoi
# build context de `COPY . .` khong keo no (va ban dung native sinh ra neu co) vao image.
apps/transport-mobile
